  "bio": "Diego Gaston, an exceptional tattoo artist based in Rio das Ostras, Brazil, boasts an impressive portfolio in black & gray and realism styles. His meticulous attention to cleanliness in his studio ensures a safe and hygienic experience for each client, reflecting his unwavering professionalism in every aspect of his work. Diego's growing list of national and international awards is a testament to the high standards he upholds in his craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Rio Das Ostras, Rio De Janeiro, Brazil"
